<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-ADAC estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-ADAC estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate for ADAC Laboratories Inc to $1.17 a share from $1.15 and raised its fiscal 1997 revenue projection to $284 million.</p>
<p>-- said the move followed second quarter results that exceeded expectations and a rise in the company's backlog from the previous quarter to $94 million in a seasonally weak quarter.</p>
<p>-- ADAC shares were 2-15/16 higher at 19-15/16 in afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
